    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;Melo's Cat Cafe&quot;</strong> is the perfect game for players who want to relax in a stress-free environment. <br>Instead of chasing goals, players can simply enjoy spending time with the cats. <br>Observe the cats as they eat and sleep, and find peace of mind in their calm presence.<br><br><strong>Main Features</strong><br><br>    <strong>Spacious Mountain Home</strong><br>        The game is set in a large house on top of a mountain with beautiful scenic views. <br>\u3000\u3000The view from the terrace is breathtaking.<br><br>    <strong>Free-Spirited Cats</strong><br>        Free-spirited and independent cats make an appearance.<br>\u3000\u3000When you click on them to pet them, they respond with a meow. <br>\u3000\u3000Observe their behaviors and be charmed by their cuteness.<br><br>    <strong>Relaxing Activities</strong><br>        Players have the freedom to act as they please,<br>\u3000\u3000without specific goals or restrictions. <br>\u3000\u3000A simple timer is provided which can be used to set work periods or serve as a break alarm.<br><br>    <strong>Interactive Environment</strong><br>        The house and garden are filled with macaron toys for the cats to play with. <br>\u3000\u3000They might seem like they\u2019re just being pushed around and played with, though.<br><br>    <strong>Chroma key compositing</strong><br>        this app can also use a magenta-based chroma key compositing mode.<br><br>\u3000<strong>Music used</strong><br>\u3000\u3000The BGM used is a song published on &quot;FREE BGM DOVA-SYNDROME&quot;, so you can use it with confidence even for monetized live performances.",
